{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Repline 是一款專為重量訓練而設的紀錄工具，適合只想專心記下每次舉起重量與次數的健身人士。它不設訂閱、不需註冊帳戶，亦沒有廣告與進階版本提示，原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。由建立課表到完成每一組，整個流程都集中在同一個畫面完成。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-215.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>手錶與手機即時互通</h2>\n<p>課表建立一次即可重複使用，每次練習只需輸入重量與次數，再按下完成鍵記錄一組。組間可設休息倒數，即使關閉程式，手錶仍會震動提醒。熱身組不會計入正式組數據，亦支援超級組與備註。它同時是真正的 Apple Watch 應用，可在手錶直接記錄整個訓練，數據與手機即時同步，個人紀錄與訓練歷史自動保存。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-247-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-248-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-249-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-250-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-251-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Repline: Workout Tracker</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/repline-workout-tracker/id6791378677?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T08:14:06.686501+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":348,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T07:59:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T12:30:45.804191+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T08:07:27.791227+00:00","content_hash":"c499afad2b8faced48c11103838a8543f6cef723c2235dd13d879995da5c2454","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}